    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A recent report shows that more and more college graduates in China are choosing to work in smaller towns and counties instead of big cities. This is a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " change from previous years. In 2018, only 20% of fresh graduates worked in smaller places six months after "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In 2022, however, this number went up to 25%."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The report, released by Mycos, identified several "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for the change. Some graduates want to be closer to their "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Others "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the stressful life in big cities. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", smaller towns and counties offer more job opportunities in the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "public sector",
            "zh": "公共部门"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The report showed that graduates who had left big cities were generally "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with their careers. Nearly 60% of them stayed in their hometowns for at least five years. Their average salary "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from 4,640 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in 2018 to 5,377 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in 2022."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Most graduates in China used to start their careers in big cities, but various factors have led them to think "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Those include ever-increasing competition for jobs and the rising "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of living in big cities. The government is also encouraging graduates to work in their "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b11",
            "number": 11
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Suichang County",
            "zh": "遂昌县"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Zhejiang province, for example, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b12",
            "number": 12
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a large "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "financial",
            "zh": "财务上的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " reward to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Master’s degree",
            "zh": "硕士学位"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " holders who return to work there."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Yang Peng, 27, is one of many young people who "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b13",
            "number": 13
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " home. He studied in Britain and got a Master’s degree. In September 2022, he took a job in Shanghai but found it too "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b14",
            "number": 14
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". After just two months, he moved back to his hometown, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Xiushui County",
            "zh": "修水县"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Jiangxi province. “"
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b15",
            "number": 15
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " here is better,” Yang said. “I can spend time with my parents and help with the family business.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
